WEBVTT

00:06:56.871 --> 00:07:00.788
noise. So they got out of the
way and then, you know,

00:07:00.788 --> 00:07:06.204
he would sit exhausted and still with
his hair bristling and they'd come

00:07:06.204 --> 00:07:11.413
and grab him. And as far as we know, there
wasn't one single serious fight,

00:07:11.413 --> 00:07:14.496
because when they fight, they tend
to pull each other's hair out

00:07:14.704 --> 00:07:18.913
and there are wounds. But Mike had neither
patches of hair nor wounds,

00:07:19.371 --> 00:07:24.954
and he reigned six years. And then
you ask about leadership.

00:07:25.454 --> 00:07:33.996
Well, Mike became alpha male, but being
an alpha doesn't make you a leader.